roompla.png\" data-image-name=\"Mysteriousmushroompla.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$5/stud<p>2000-6000/Cap</p></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$103.75/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$129.68/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1.4.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 10th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>Mysterious Mushrooms are a type of <a href=\"/wiki/Mushrooms\" title=\"Mushrooms\">Mushroom</a> found in <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertainty_Cave\" title=\"Uncertainty Cave\">Uncertainty Cave</a> (Inside Desert Canyons). They are found scattered on the ceiling of the cave. These mushrooms shoot projectiles toward players who come close to them. The projectiles themselves do little damage; since there are many of these mushrooms in the cave, however, the collective damage received is considerable. Note that the mushrooms can't shoot projectiles without their cap, albeit chopped down caps don't shoot projectiles.\n</p><p>When a player is hit by a Mysterious Mushroom's projectile, the player is launched upwards. This allows the player to reach the anti-gravity zone, where the player can cut Mysterious Mushrooms down from the cave ceiling. While in the anti-gravity zone, the player can \"swim\" or float in the air.\n</p><p>Mysterious Mushroom wood can take 3 to 4 hits using the <a href=\"/wiki/Tall_Refined_Axe\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tall Refined Axe\">Tall Refined Axe</a>. Depending on the size, the mushroom can yield anywhere from $2,000 upward to $6,000.  With recent update (as of the date of this edit), every tree can have various size, and Mysterious Mushroom's cap can get to $9,000 a cap at rare chance (!)\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quest_Information\">Quest Information</span></h3>\n<p>For the special quest in obtaining the <a href=\"/wiki/Uncertain_Pickaxe\" title=\"Uncertain Pickaxe\">Uncertain Pickaxe</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/%3F_%3F_%3F\" title=\"? ? ?\">Infused Ink</a> is needed. If refined or forged <a href=\"/wiki/Inkstone\" title=\"Inkstone\">Inkstone</a> comes into contact with a projectile fired from a Mysterious Mushroom, it will turn into Infused Ink.\n</p><p>For the special quest in obtaining a <a href=\"/wiki/Fusion_Coil\" title=\"Fusion Coil\">Fusion Coil</a>, an Infused Core is needed. If a <a href=\"/wiki/Meteor_core\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Meteor core\">Meteor Core</a> comes into contact with a projectile fired from a Mysterious Mushroom, it will turn into an <a href=\"/wiki/Infused_Core\" title=\"Infused Core\">Infused Core</a>.\n</p><p>On other cases with normal trees, the projectile turned them into <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupted\" title=\"Corrupted\">Corrupted</a> wood - a general wood defined for all trees being hit (not just Mushroom, but every tree. Have tested with <a href=\"/wiki/Palm\" title=\"Palm\">Palm</a> tree)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-1\" hash=\"e82bc708e5e20bbcc52f9388310ff165\" data-seq-no=\"1\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:117px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Mysterious_Mushrooms-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:104px; width:185px; top:5.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Mysterious_Mushrooms.png\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms.png (221 KB)\" style=\"height:104px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a1/Mysterious_Mushrooms.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230508205249\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms.png (221 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Shooting\" height=\"115\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Mysterious Mushrooms.png\" data-image-key=\"Mysterious_Mushrooms.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Shooting\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms.png (221 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Shooting\" height=\"115\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Mysterious Mushrooms.png\" data-image-key=\"Mysterious_Mushrooms.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Shooting\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a1/Mysterious_Mushrooms.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230508205249\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Shooting</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:117px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Mystery_mush_on_ground-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:115px; width:185px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Mystery_mush_on_ground.png\" title=\"Mystery mush on ground.png (179 KB)\" style=\"height:115px; width:185px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e7/Mystery_mush_on_ground.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230912051513\" title=\"Mystery mush on ground.png (179 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Growing on ground glitch\" height=\"115\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Mystery mush on ground.png\" data-image-key=\"Mystery_mush_on_ground.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Growing on ground glitch\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Mystery mush on ground.png (179 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Growing on ground glitch\" height=\"115\" width=\"185\" data-image-name=\"Mystery mush on ground.png\" data-image-key=\"Mystery_mush_on_ground.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Growing on ground glitch\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e7/Mystery_mush_on_ground.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20230912051513\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Growing on ground glitch</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Prior to the Oaklands map update, players used to be able to use the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabby_Grabber\" title=\"Grabby Grabber\">Grabby Grabber</a> or the <a href=\"/wiki/Grabbiest_Grabber\" title=\"Grabbiest Grabber\">Grabbiest Grabber</a> to easily reach the harder-to-reach Mysterious Mushrooms by \"grabby-hopping\" using a mushroom cap. Grabby-hopping has been removed in the Oaklands Map update, thus this method has become obsolete.</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Gravity_Coil\" title=\"Gravity Coil\">Gravity Coil</a> can be used to retrieve lower-hanging mushrooms. When hit by a mushroom's projectile while holding the Gravity Coil, the anti-gravity effect caused by the projectile becomes much stronger.</li>\n<li>Refined or planked Mysterious Mushroom wood was the most valuable wood type in the game hitherto the introduction of <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma</a>.</li>\n<li>Sanded Mysterious Mushroom wood is one of several sources of neon material in the game, alongside sanded <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Tree\" title=\"Electrified Tree\">Electrified Tree</a>, sanded <a href=\"/wiki/Magma_Tree\" title=\"Magma Tree\">Magma</a>, all forms of  <a href=\"/wiki/Electrified_Bamboo\" title=\"Electrified Bamboo\">Electrified Bamboo,</a> and forged <a href=\"/wiki/Uranium\" title=\"Uranium\">Uranium</a>.</li>\n<li>There is a rare glitch whereby the Mysterious Mushrooms can grow from the ground. Due to weird spawning logic (and/or improper value which includes this), the mushrooms can spawn on the ground, flipping over time while growing; they stop when the lowest stem is fully grown. They still can be harvested as normally, only they are hidden inside the ground. This phenomenon can also happen when growing on the ceiling, except it's normal.</li>\n<li>The Mysterious Mushroom is one of three wood types that aren't made of wood, the other being <a href=\"/wiki/Mushrooms\" title=\"Mushrooms\">Mushrooms</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Kelp\" title=\"Kelp\">Kelp</a>.</li>\n<li>The Internal Name of the Mysterious Mushroom is called \"AlienMushroom,\" which could be the reason why it glows a neon texture and grows on the ceiling.</li>\n<li>If the Mysterious Mushroom is hit once, it acts dormant and stops shooting. This can be very useful for grinding Mysterious Mushrooms.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Mysterious Mushrooms (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6TXlzdGVyaW91c19NdXNocm9vbXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></span> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Mysterious_Mushrooms\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Mysterious_Mushrooms?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; font-size:95%; padding:0; text-align:left; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\" class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"background:#372A27; font-size:100%; border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; text-align:center\"><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Trees\" title=\"Category:Trees\"><b>Tree</b></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"navbox-group\" style=\"width:10%; background:#372A27; font-size:100%; border-radius:5px 5px 0 0; text-align:center\"><small><a href=\"/wiki/Category:Trees\" title=\"Category:Trees\"><b>Trees</b></a></small>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding-left:4px\"><a href=\"/wiki/Acacia\" title=\"Acacia\">Acacia</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Ash_Tree\" title=\"Ash Tree\">Ash Tree</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Bamboo\" title=\"Bamboo\">Bamboo</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Baobab\" title=\"Baobab\">Baobab</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Birch\" title=\"Birch\">Birch</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Pine\" title=\"Blue Pine\">Blue Pine</a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Bone_Tree\" title=\"Bone Tree\">Bone Tree</a> • <a 